{"about_the_game":"Get ready to gallop through scenic locations with your majestic horse to find all the hidden animals!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927410/extras/overlook.jpg?t=1650525779\" /><br><br>Begin your journey as an adventurous horse on a quest to explore the world, and find some animal friends along the way. <br>Travel through 8 different locales and 29 levels to save the hidden wildlife. <br>Unlock 11 unique horses and choose over 56 different hair colors to style your horse. <br>Seek out the mysterious spirits who will grant your horse mystical powers. <br>Relax and take your time experiencing each location, or challenge yourself to to speed run the levels; it's up to you!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927410/extras/dogs.jpg?t=1650525779\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Places to Visit</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pleasant Isle - a small peaceful island, with easier to find animals<br></li><li> Lazy River - trot along rocky lowlands with a river running through it<br></li><li> Desert Canyon - gallop through desert canyon terraces under the hot sun<br></li><li> Dark Woods - wander through thick fog in this shrouded forest<br></li><li> Tranquil Taiga - explore the serene landscape of the northern mountains<br></li><li> Tropical Islands - paddle between the palm tree islands to find all the animals<br></li><li> Horizon Highlands - experience evening around the lakes in the highlands<br></li><li> ??? - discover the bonus world and soar to victory</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927410/extras/AnimalsSlide.jpg?t=1650525779\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Animals to Find</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Beagles<br></li><li> Cats<br></li><li> Camels<br></li><li> Bears<br></li><li> Penguins<br></li><li> Rabbits<br></li><li> Turtles<br></li><li> Plus many more!